Simple Sound Generator — licence information
============================================

Copyright (c) 2026 the Simple Sound Generator contributors

This file has four parts: the licence for the application code (1), the terms
that apply to the AI models the app downloads (2), the third-party software it
installs (3), and notes on changing this licence (4). Part 1 does NOT cover the
model weights or the audio you generate with them — see part 2.


